nt and ansible-lint standards. It is structured to be included in an Ansible Role under the tasks/ directory, and it contains the tasks exactly as described. The playbook checks for systemd usage, retrieves the latest Loki release, sets the promtail version, tests for the presence of a local archive, asserts the existence of a local binary, retrieves a checksum list, and gets a checksum for a specific architecture.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'codestral:22b', 'created_at': '2025-10-17T08:56:15.975381741Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 19290674847, 'load_duration': 16075188, 'prompt_eval_count': 1113, 'prompt_eval_duration': 1003280209, 'eval_count': 771, 'eval_duration': 18270643266, 'model_name': 'codestral:22b'} id='run--adafee9b-7687-417a-a179-e2d98079cf90-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1113, 'output_tokens': 771, 'total_tokens': 1884}
