Task 5: Create Kubernetes API health check script for Debian OS family  
Description Task 5: Deploy the Kubernetes API health check script for Debian family by templating check_apiserver.sh.j2 to /etc/keepalived/check_apiserver.sh with owner root, group root, mode 0755, using ansible.builtin.template. This task runs only when ansible_facts['os_family'] == "Debian" and notifies the handler Restart keepalived.  

Task 6: Create Kubernetes API health check script for RedHat OS famliy  
